name 'iterating-with-ai-postassessment-q12_2025'

question 'In a schema, why is it risky to name a field `val1` instead of `product_price`?'

wrong 'The AI will charge more for processing shorter names.'
wrong '`val1` is a reserved word in JavaScript that will cause a crash.'
right 'The AI may misinterpret `val1` as a name or date, generating incorrect filtering logic.'
wrong 'Field names must be at least 10 characters long to be secure.'

allow_multiple_attempts false

teacher_markdown <<MARKDOWN
Lesson 10

Clear, semantic field names help AI tools "reason" about the data, leading to more accurate code suggestions and reducing logic errors.
MARKDOWN
